# The Hinterlands, Rut'theran Village and Darnassus, Darkshire, the Blasted
# Lands and Loch Modan, Alliance 46 to 48. Consensus route visits 49 to 54:
# a run of short stops that clears the errands carried from Feralas and
# Tanaris.
#
# Flow: Aerie Peak (the Altar of Zul, Skulk Rock), Darkshire (Nethergarde
# supplies), Nethergarde Keep, the bloodmages' beast loop and back to the
# keep's flight master, Loch Modan
# (Ironband's last quests and Ghak's reagents) with the bind in Thelsamar,
# then Rut'theran Village and Darnassus (Tyrande, Gracina, Fandral's Un'Goro
# Soil; Druids train) last, at level 47, and the hearth back to Thelsamar. Searing Gorge
# follows.
#
# Deviations from the export: the Rut'theran turn-ins of In Search of
# Knowledge (2939), Feralas: A History (2940) and Handle With Care (3022) are
# done here, where the route passes Rut'theran on the way into Darnassus,
# instead of on a separate trip to Teldrassil at 51 (export visit 58, dropped
# from 07-un-goro-crater in exchange). The Darnassus stop stays although it needs a
# boat: it ends two chains (Doling Justice, Rise of the Silithid), hands in
# the Rut'theran errands and gives Un'Goro Soil (3764) for the Un'Goro guide.
# Darnassus comes last instead of right after the Hinterlands: Fandral's
# quests need level 47, which the Blasted Lands and Loch Modan quests reach;
# the travel is the same (two boat crossings, the hearth brings you back to
# Thelsamar). Nethergarde Keep comes before the bloodmages' beasts: the
# Crate of Power Stones (1395) vanishes an hour after Darkshire (ItemSparse
# 6091, 3600 s), and the beasts and the ride from Darkshire took 92 minutes
# under the simulator with the keep last. After the bloodmages you ride back
# to the keep and leave from its flight master. In Loch Modan the route
# lands in Thelsamar, so Ghak Healtouch comes first and Ironband second.
#
# Dropped, for the flow: the Booty Bay stop (export visit 53: a hearth, a
# flight there and a long flight back to Loch Modan) with Deliver to
# MacKinley (2874), Message in a Bottle (594, a 25% chance per bottle) and the
# three OOX rescues and An OOX of Your Own (2767, 648, 836, 3721: their beacons
# are 0.5-2.5% drops). With it go Find and Rescue OOX-09/HL! (485, 836) here.
# Look To The Stars (181): a level 30 quest whose ogre sits across Duskwood
# from Darkshire. Badlands Reagent Run (2500): the earlier guides hand it in
# themselves. The binds at Craftsmen's Terrace, Darkshire and Booty Bay: no
# hearth uses them. The net loss is about 4000 experience (0.05 of a level),
# too little for a grind stop.
#
# Carried on: Favored of Elune? (3661), taken from Erelas at Rut'theran; its
# feathers are picked up and it is handed in at the end of
# 50-60/01-burning-steppes, which opens Moontouched Wildkin (978).
#
# Left out: Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient (2641: the Violet Tragan grows here,
# but the route never takes it back to Gadgetzan), Whiskey Slim's Lost Grog
# (580) and The Borrower (2941): never handed in by the route.
guide forever/alliance/40-50/05-the-hinterlands
title The Hinterlands, Blasted Lands & Loch Modan
faction Alliance
levels 46-48
zone The Hinterlands
next forever/alliance/40-50/06-searing-gorge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Aerie Peak

step Aerie Peak
  sethome "Aerie Peak" npc 7744       -- Innkeeper Thulfram: the last guide binds here, so this usually ticks at once
  accept 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle
  accept 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe

step The Altar of Zul
  tip Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.
  complete 2989 @49.0,68.7

step Skulk Rock
  tip Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it.
  kill 2655 quest 2877                -- Green Sludge
  kill 2656 quest 2877                -- Jade Ooze

step Aerie Peak
  tip Hearth to Aerie Peak.
  hearth "Aerie Peak"                 -- Hearthstone on cooldown? Ride back north-west.
  turnin 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle
  turnin 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe
  accept 2990                         -- for Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep, later

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshire

step Darkshire
  zone Duskwood
  tip Fly from Aerie Peak to Darkshire.
  fly "Darkshire"
  turnin 1477                         -- Watchmaster Sorigal
  accept 1395

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Blasted Lands

step The bloodmages
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Ride east through Deadwind Pass into the Swamp of Sorrows and south down the road into the Blasted Lands. The bloodmages' camp is the first stop beside the road.
  accept 2581                         -- Bloodmage Drazial
  accept 2583
  accept 2585
  accept 2601                         -- Bloodmage Lynnore
  accept 2603

step Nethergarde Keep
  tip Ride on east along the road to the keep first: the Crate of Power Stones expires an hour after Darkshire, and the bloodmages' beasts take longer than that.
  getfp "Nethergarde Keep" npc 8609   -- Alexandra Constantine
  turnin 1395                         -- Quartermaster Lungertz
  turnin 2990                         -- Thadius Grimshade, at the top of the keep
  note Thadius' next task, Nekrum's Medallion, is a Zul'Farrak quest: skip it.
  turnin 1364                         -- Watcher Mahar Ba
  turnin 1425

step Boars and basilisks
  tip Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of the keep. Keep clear of the Helboars further south: they are level 52.
  collect 8392 quest 2581             -- Blasted Boar Lung
  collect 8392 quest 2583
  collect 8392 quest 2585
  collect 8394 quest 2601             -- Basilisk Brain
  collect 8394 quest 2583

step Scorpoks and snickerfangs
  tip Ride west: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills just south of the bloodmages' camp; Scorpok Stingers (level 50) scuttle across the middle of the north. Black Slayer vultures circle over all of it. Pull one at a time.
  collect 8391 quest 2581             -- Snickerfang Jowl
  collect 8391 quest 2603
  collect 8393 quest 2581             -- Scorpok Pincer
  collect 8393 quest 2583
  collect 8393 quest 2585
  collect 8396 quest 2603             -- Vulture Gizzard
  collect 8396 quest 2601
  collect 8396 quest 2585

step The bloodmages
  turnin 2601                         -- Bloodmage Lynnore
  turnin 2603
  turnin 2581                         -- Bloodmage Drazial
  turnin 2583
  turnin 2585
  note The bloodmages' second tier pays for the same parts with a buff item and no experience: skip it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loch Modan

step Thelsamar
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Ride back east to Nethergarde Keep and fly to Thelsamar.
  fly "Thelsamar"
  sethome "Stoutlager Inn" npc 6734   -- Innkeeper Hearthstove
  accept 17                           -- Ghak Healtouch

step Ironband's Excavation Site
  tip Ride east along the south shore of the loch to Ironband's camp.
  turnin 739                          -- Prospector Ironband
  turnin 707
  accept 704

step The Uldaman dig
  zone Badlands
  tip Ride south through the pass into the Badlands' northern edge: the Stonevault troggs dig outside Uldaman there. The carved urns and the magenta mushroom clusters sit in their caves and tunnels, outside the dungeon itself.
  collect 4610 quest 704              -- Carved Stone Urn
  collect 8047 quest 17               -- Magenta Fungus Cap

step Ironband's Excavation Site
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Ride back north to Ironband's camp.
  turnin 704                          -- Prospector Ironband

step Thelsamar
  turnin 17                           -- Ghak Healtouch

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rut'theran Village and Darnassus

step Rut'theran Village
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Fly from Thelsamar to Menethil Harbor, take the boat to Auberdine and fly to Rut'theran Village.
  turnin 2939                         -- Daryn Lightwind
  accept 2940 object 142958           -- the book on her table
  turnin 2940
  note Daryn's next errand goes to Tanaris: skip it.
  turnin 3022                         -- Erelas Ambersky
  accept 3661                         -- Erelas Ambersky: keep it, the feathers come at the end of the Burning Steppes guide

step Temple of the Moon
  zone Darnassus
  tip Step through the portal into Darnassus. The Temple of the Moon is in the south of the city.
  turnin 2972                         -- Tyrande Whisperwind
  turnin 162                          -- Gracina Spiritmight, beside her

step Craftsmen's Terrace
  accept 3763 lvl 47                  -- Innkeeper Saelienne

step Cenarion Enclave
  turnin 3763                         -- Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, at the top of the tree
  accept 3764 lvl 47                  -- the soil comes from Un'Goro Crater, later
  train class only Druid              -- The druid trainers stand in the Enclave; Ironforge has none

step Back to Thelsamar
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Hearth to Thelsamar. The Searing Gorge guide starts at Thorium Point: from here, ride south into the Badlands, west past the Horde town of Kargath and up the trail into the gorge.
  hearth "Stoutlager Inn"
